1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,900
Last year Malaysians lost RM1.46 billion to fake
investment scams, the costliest scam in the country.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,567
Young Malaysians score below the national average
in financial literacy.

3
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:34,900
Without knowing what a realistic return looks like,
it's hard to tell a real investment from a fake one.

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:49,900
First-year students manage money alone for the first
time, and that's where syndicates look for victims.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,841
This is Celik: one university
semester inside a pretend phone.

6
00:01:00,941 --> 00:01:04,900
It works fully offline.

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,525
Week one: split your money.

8
00:01:10,625 --> 00:01:24,900
The emergency fund you build now
decides how tempted you'll be later.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,199
First pay?

10
00:01:27,299 --> 00:01:40,762
Mesin Masa shows what RM50 a
month becomes by 30 and by 55.

11
00:01:40,862 --> 00:01:44,900
Example rate only.

12
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,103
Two investment offers.

13
00:01:50,203 --> 00:01:58,616
One is licensed, with risk and fees.

14
00:01:58,716 --> 00:02:05,711
The other promises 30% a week.

15
00:02:05,811 --> 00:02:17,299
Tap Kira dulu: that's
millions of percent a year.

16
00:02:17,399 --> 00:02:19,900
Impossible.

17
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:28,606
A senior offers RM1,500
to 'borrow' your account.

18
00:02:28,706 --> 00:02:30,560
Looks easy.

19
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:44,951
But your account becomes a route for scam
money, and you're the one investigated.

20
00:02:45,051 --> 00:02:54,900
In Celik you can make the
mistake safely, and try again.

21
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,309
Pay later?

22
00:02:58,409 --> 00:03:09,900
Kos Sebenar reveals the real rate.

23
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:29,900
Learning fades fast, so Celik has Cek
Harian: two minutes a day, with a streak.

24
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:44,900
And Celik trains the real actions: call
NSRC 997 and check an account on Semak Mule.

25
00:03:45,000 --> 00:04:04,900
For orientation week, Mod Kelas runs a
whole hall's battle from one screen.

26
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:19,900
At the end of the semester: a report card
for financial literacy and scam immunity.

27
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,159
Free for every student.

28
00:04:24,259 --> 00:04:29,900
Celik: money-smart, scam-proof.

